{"title":"CLASSIC COLLECTION","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTimeless in design and uncompromising in performance, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eClassic Collection\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e celebrates the enduring beauty of traditional cue craftsmanship.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuilt with carefully selected premium hardwoods, each cue highlights the natural character and elegance of the wood through clean lines, balanced proportions, and refined detailing. Free from excessive ornamentation, the Classic Collection focuses on what truly matters—exceptional craftsmanship, superior playability, and lasting quality.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"crimson-legacy-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","title":"Maple x Ebony Wood Points (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Built from premium \u003cstrong\u003eCanadian maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, this cue features rich crimson points accented by dark veneers, creating a striking contrast that showcases the natural beauty of the wood. A luxurious \u003cstrong\u003ered crocodile-embossed leather wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e completes the design, delivering a refined look and confident feel.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWeight:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 29.5 inches\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eForearm:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Canadian Maple\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWrap:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Red Crocodile-Embossed Leather\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEvery Cues Master cue is individually handcrafted, ensuring each piece is one of a kind while meeting the high standards of precision, balance, and craftsmanship that define our brand. Designed for players and collectors alike, the Crimson Legacy pairs classic cue-making tradition with a bold, sophisticated aesthetic.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhether you're matching it with your favorite shaft or adding a standout piece to your collection, this cue is built to perform and made to be admired.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eOwn the legacy. Play with distinction.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453056778288,"sku":null,"price":15000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/9dce2545-cb3d-4e81-9c1a-82abc0a96fe7.png?v=1785639889"},{"product_id":"royal-eclipse-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt","title":"Maple x Spalted Tamarind 12 pointer (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp\u003e Crafted from \u003cstrong\u003epremium figured Canadian maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, this cue features \u003cstrong\u003espalted tamarind points\u003c\/strong\u003e accented with \u003cstrong\u003epurple veneers\u003c\/strong\u003e, creating a striking contrast that highlights the natural beauty of both woods. Finished with a \u003cstrong\u003eblack crocodile-embossed leather wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e, it offers a luxurious feel and a secure, comfortable grip.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery Cues Master cue is handcrafted with precision and attention to detail, ensuring each piece is as unique as the player who owns it. Whether paired with your favorite shaft for competitive play or displayed as part of a premium collection, the \u003cstrong\u003eRoyal Eclipse\u003c\/strong\u003e delivers the perfect balance of beauty, craftsmanship, and performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5 inches\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Figured Canadian Maple with Spalted Tamarind Points and Purple Veneers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWrap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Black Crocodile-Embossed Leather\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Figured Canadian Maple with Spalted Tamarind Points and Purple Veneers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for players who appreciate understated luxury, the \u003cstrong\u003eRoyal Eclipse\u003c\/strong\u003e combines premium materials with expert craftsmanship. The figured maple, distinctive spalted tamarind, and bold purple veneers create a cue that is both visually captivating and built for lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHandcrafted with precision. Built to perform. Designed to be remembered.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453158522928,"sku":null,"price":20000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/a5426051-3320-4f34-9bcd-7641225901d1.png?v=1785641669"},{"product_id":"sovereign-point-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","title":"Maple x 12 Pointer Abalone (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eCrafted from \u003cstrong\u003eCanadian maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, this custom cue butt showcases elegant long points enhanced by meticulously handcrafted \u003cstrong\u003eabalone inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e, creating a sophisticated design that is both bold and understated. Finished with a \u003cstrong\u003epremium Black Croco wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e, it offers a luxurious feel and a secure, comfortable grip for confident play.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for discerning players and collectors alike, the Sovereign Point embodies the precision, balance, and attention to detail that define every Cues Master creation. Whether paired with your preferred shaft or displayed as part of a distinguished collection, it is a timeless expression of craftsmanship and enduring style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWood:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Canadian Maple\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long Point Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInlays:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Inlays\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWrap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Black Croco Wrap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butt Only (Shaft Not Included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClassic design. Exceptional craftsmanship. Built to perform and admired for a lifetime.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453366206512,"sku":null,"price":21000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/5a3bd649-d01e-4e13-9de8-316be2c3484e.png?v=1785650858"},{"product_id":"untitled-aug6_03-12-08","title":"Northern Ember – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Cues Master","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStriking, refined, and deeply rooted in natural beauty, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNorthern Ember\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue that brings together elegant Canadian maple, dramatic organic wood grain, and contemporary resin artistry. The \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium Canadian maple forearm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides a clean, warm foundation, enhanced by meticulously handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e that introduce depth, color, and character to the design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe cue transitions into a distinctive \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003espalted wood butt sleeve\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, showcasing naturally occurring grain patterns that make every piece truly one of a kind. Rich \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin accents\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e flow throughout the design, creating a seamless connection between the natural wood elements, while the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin grip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e adds a modern aesthetic with a smooth and comfortable feel in the hand.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCompleting the design are \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin rings\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, adding clean lines and visual balance throughout the cue. The combination of Canadian maple, dramatic spalted wood, handcrafted inlays, and vibrant resin creates a contemporary masterpiece where \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003etraditional artisan craftsmanship meets modern cue design\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuilt for players who appreciate individuality and exceptional craftsmanship, the Northern Ember is more than a playing cue—it is a statement piece. Every grain, inlay, resin detail, and handcrafted element contributes to a cue that is unmistakably unique.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eForearm:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Canadian Maple with Handcrafted Resin Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHandle \/ Grip:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Custom Resin Grip\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Spalted Wood with Resin Accents\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRings:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Resin Rings\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrand:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Cues Master\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNatural beauty. Bold character. Modern craftsmanship. A one-of-a-kind cue built to be played, admired, and remembered.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43461354258480,"sku":null,"price":20000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/123.png?v=1786593600"},{"product_id":"emerald-frost-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Emerald Frost – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Cues Master","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eElegant, distinctive, and meticulously handcrafted, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEmerald Frost\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e brings together the natural warmth of premium Canadian maple, the bold character of emerald resin, and the iridescent beauty of abalone. Designed with a striking balance of color, texture, and precision, this custom pool cue is a modern expression of refined cue-making artistry.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium Canadian maple forearm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e serves as a clean natural canvas for carefully handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin and abalone inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Long, tapered inlays flow gracefully along the forearm, creating a sharp and symmetrical pattern that contrasts beautifully against the maple grain. Subtle abalone details introduce flashes of natural iridescence, adding depth and sophistication to the design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe cue transitions into a distinctive \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ewhite resin grip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, featuring a flowing pattern that complements the deep green resin while creating a crisp, contemporary contrast. Matching green resin details continue through the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ebutt sleeve\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, bringing visual harmony to the entire cue. Completing the design are meticulously handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eabalone rings\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, adding refined flashes of color throughout the ringwork.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuilt for players who demand both artistry and performance, the Emerald Frost is equipped with a \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium Kielwood shaft\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBlack Diamond tip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, and \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUS phenolic ferrule\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e for a solid, responsive, and consistent hit. A precision \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRadial pin\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e completes the connection between butt and shaft.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eForearm:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Canadian Maple with Handcrafted Resin \u0026amp; Abalone Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGrip:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Custom White Resin Grip\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Canadian Maple \u0026amp; Green Resin with Abalone Details\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlays:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Resin \u0026amp; Abalone Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRings:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Rings\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eShaft:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Kielwood Shaft\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTip:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Black Diamond Tip\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFerrule:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e US Phenolic Ferrule\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrand:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Cues Master\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNatural maple. Emerald resin. Iridescent abalone. Precision craftsmanship. Emerald Frost is where bold modern design meets the timeless art of handcrafted cue making.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43484561211440,"sku":null,"price":28000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/121314.png?v=1786599559"},{"product_id":"emerald-sovereign-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Emerald Sovereign – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Cues Master","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRefined, commanding, and crafted with an unmistakable sense of luxury, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEmerald Sovereign\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue that celebrates the natural character of premium ashwood and the timeless beauty of abalone. Its design brings together organic wood grain, rich resin accents, and intricate handcrafted details to create a cue with a distinctly regal presence.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium ashwood\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides a light, elegant foundation for meticulously handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin and abalone inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Sophisticated geometric patterns flow through the forearm and butt sleeve, combining rich resin accents with the natural iridescence of abalone to create a design that is intricate yet perfectly balanced.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA premium \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLuxe wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e adds a rich, refined texture to the handle while creating a striking contrast against the lighter ashwood. Carefully crafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eabalone rings\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e introduce subtle flashes of color throughout the cue, tying the inlay work together and adding another layer of sophistication.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEvery element of the Emerald Sovereign is thoughtfully crafted to achieve a harmonious balance between natural wood, deep resin tones, and iridescent abalone artistry. Designed for discerning players and collectors alike, it is a cue that commands attention in the hands and stands proudly as a centerpiece in any collection.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWood:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Ashwood\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlays:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Resin \u0026amp; Abalone Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWrap:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Luxe Wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRings:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Rings\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrand:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Cues Master\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNatural ashwood. Rich resin. Iridescent abalone. Timeless luxury—crafted into a cue with a presence all its own.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43484565569584,"sku":null,"price":18000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/141516_68f88d20-5050-4f7f-b392-f3671e97be93.png?v=1786599818"},{"product_id":"obsidian-crown-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Obsidian Crown – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Cues Master","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDark, refined, and unmistakably luxurious, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eObsidian Crown\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue defined by the dramatic contrast of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eblack-stained Canadian maple\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e and shimmering natural abalone. Its sophisticated design embraces understated luxury, allowing the rich dark finish and intricate handcrafted details to command attention without excess.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium Canadian maple\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is carefully stained in deep black, creating a sleek, uniform foundation that allows the meticulously handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eabalone inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e to take center stage. Slender inlay elements flow elegantly through the forearm and butt sleeve, revealing flashes of natural iridescence against the dark finish and creating remarkable depth and movement.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe handle is finished with a premium \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eblack crocodile wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, adding distinctive texture, luxurious character, and a comfortable feel in the hand. Its rich surface complements the polished black maple while reinforcing the cue's bold and sophisticated identity.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSubtle \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ecustom decorative ringwork\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides clean definition throughout the cue, while the precision \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRadial pin\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e delivers a solid and secure connection between the butt and shaft.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCreated for discerning players and collectors who appreciate quiet luxury and exceptional craftsmanship, the Obsidian Crown brings together dark Canadian maple, natural abalone artistry, and refined detailing in one commanding design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWood:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Black-Stained Canadian Maple\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlays:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWrap:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Black Crocodile Wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRingwork:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Custom Decorative Ringwork\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrand:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Cues Master\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDark maple. Iridescent abalone. Crocodile texture. Quiet luxury with a commanding presence—the Obsidian Crown.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43484582379568,"sku":null,"price":25000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/171819.png?v=1786600191"},{"product_id":"imperial-geometry-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Imperial Geometry – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Cues Master","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eElegant, precise, and unmistakably distinctive, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eImperial Geometry\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue that brings together the timeless beauty of premium Canadian maple and the intricate artistry of handcrafted inlays. Its architectural design creates a refined balance between natural wood, bold geometric forms, and luxurious iridescent details.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium Canadian maple forearm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides a clean, sophisticated foundation for a striking arrangement of meticulously handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin and abalone inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Sharp geometric forms flow along the cue in a carefully balanced composition, combining contrasting shapes, rich resin tones, and shimmering abalone accents. The result is a bold, architectural aesthetic that adds visual depth while preserving the natural warmth of the maple.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMatching \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin and abalone detailing\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e continues through the butt sleeve, creating seamless visual continuity from forearm to butt. Custom \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eresin rings\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e complement the geometric inlay pattern, adding clean separation and a refined finishing touch.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA premium \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003esynthetic wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides a comfortable, secure grip while creating a sophisticated contrast against the natural maple and intricate butt design. The precision \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRadial pin\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e completes the construction with a solid and dependable connection between the butt and shaft.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCreated for discerning players and collectors who appreciate meticulous craftsmanship and distinctive design, the Imperial Geometry represents the harmony of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eprecision, elegance, and individuality\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e that defines a Cues Master creation.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWood:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Canadian Maple\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlays:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Resin \u0026amp; Abalone Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWrap:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Synthetic Wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRings:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Custom Resin Rings\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrand:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Cues Master\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePrecision in every line. Character in every detail. The Imperial Geometry is handcrafted for those who appreciate the artistry behind the game.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43484697067568,"sku":null,"price":25000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/123_783d9ed9-8701-42b6-8ab1-060e374da4d6.png?v=1786605090"},{"product_id":"sapphire-noir-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Sapphire Noir – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Cues Master","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBold, sophisticated, and designed to command attention, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSapphire Noir\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue that brings together the natural character of premium ashwood, vivid blue resin, and the unmistakable shimmer of abalone. Its striking contrast creates a refined yet powerful aesthetic that balances modern design with timeless craftsmanship.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium ashwood forearm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e showcases warm, distinctive grain patterns that contrast beautifully against vibrant \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eblue resin inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Carefully handcrafted geometric patterns combine rich resin with delicate \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eabalone inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, creating visual depth and movement while allowing the natural beauty of the wood to remain an integral part of the design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe design continues into the lower section with a bold \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eblue resin butt sleeve\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, creating a strong visual connection with the forearm while adding depth and color. Meticulously handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eabalone rings\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e introduce subtle flashes of iridescence throughout the cue, tying the individual design elements together with refined detail.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA premium \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eblack crocodile wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e completes the handle, adding distinctive texture, luxurious character, and a comfortable feel in the hand. The precision \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRadial pin\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides a solid and dependable connection between the butt and shaft.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCreated for discerning players and collectors who appreciate bold design without sacrificing elegance, the Sapphire Noir is a distinctive expression of handcrafted cue artistry—where natural wood, vivid resin, shimmering abalone, and premium detailing come together in perfect balance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWood:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Ashwood\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlays:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Resin \u0026amp; Abalone Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Blue Resin\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWrap:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Black Crocodile Wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRings:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Rings\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrand:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Cues Master\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNatural ashwood. Deep blue resin. Iridescent abalone. Crocodile texture. A bold expression of handcrafted luxury—the Sapphire Noir.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43484724330544,"sku":null,"price":18000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/456_3ba00a3a-7711-4da7-8546-184d0e3ede67.png?v=1786606483"},{"product_id":"royal-ember-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Royal Ember – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Cues Master","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBold, luxurious, and crafted with a commanding presence, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRoyal Ember\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue that brings together the striking beauty of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eblack-stained Canadian maple and rich rosewood\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e with the brilliance of handcrafted abalone and vibrant multi-colored veneers.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium Canadian maple forearm, stained in deep black\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, provides a dramatic foundation for striking \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003erosewood and abalone inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, framed by carefully layered \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003emulti-colored veneers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. The combination creates exceptional contrast and visual depth while highlighting the precision and artistry of the handcrafted design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe centerpiece continues through the handle with a rich \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ered crocodile wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, adding luxurious texture, a confident grip, and a powerful burst of color against the deep black and warm rosewood tones. Its deep crimson character gives the cue a distinctive identity while maintaining an elegant and sophisticated presence.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMeticulously crafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eabalone rings\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e add subtle flashes of natural iridescence throughout the cue, tying the inlay work together and providing a refined finishing detail. Every element has been thoughtfully balanced to create a design that feels both classic and contemporary.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCreated for discerning players and collectors, the Royal Ember combines \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium hardwoods, intricate inlay work, layered veneers, natural abalone, and luxury materials\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e into a truly commanding custom cue. It is a statement of craftsmanship designed for those who appreciate individuality and exceptional detail.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWoods:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Black-Stained Canadian Maple \u0026amp; Rosewood\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlays:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Rosewood \u0026amp; Abalone Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eVeneers:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Custom Multi-Colored Veneers\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWrap:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Red Crocodile Wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRings:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Rings\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrand:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Cues Master\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u0